OL,3,AUS woman who killed her children was
OL,4,A'damn good mother' suffering psychosis,
OL,5,Adefence says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn American woman who killed her three
OL,8,Fchildren was a "damn good mother" who
OL,9,Fwas suffering from psychosis, her
OL,10,Fdefence lawyer says at her murder trial
OL,12,FKevin Reddington says the children were
OL,13,Fkilled by Lindsay Clancy in a
OL,14,F"horrible, horrific act"
OL,16,FThe 36-year-old is charged with three
OL,17,Fcounts of first-degree murder over the
OL,18,Fdeaths of Cora, five, Dawson, three,
OL,19,Fand eight-month-old Callan in 2023
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
