OL,3,AUS woman who killed her children was
OL,4,A'damn good mother' suffering psychosis,
OL,5,Adefence says
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors allege the former labour
OL,8,Fand delivery nurse intentionally
OL,9,Fstrangled and killed her children
OL,11,FClancy has not disputed that she killed
OL,12,Fher children, but her lawyers argue she
OL,13,Fshould not be held legally responsible
OL,14,Fbecause she was suffering from
OL,15,Fpostpartum psychosis
OL,17,FThe jury will soon consider verdicts -
OL,18,Fwhat options do they have?
